---
import { ShieldCheck, Repeat, Globe, CheckCircle2 } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section class="py-24 bg-dark-950 border-t border-white/5 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 mb-4">
        <span>SENSOR & SIMULATION EXPANSION</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        具身硬件与世界模型矩阵
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base leading-relaxed">
        涵盖六轴力觉、真机双臂遥操作与物理级世界模型仿真引擎。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- JunXi Hex Card -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-dark-900 border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-cyan/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-cyan/10 border border-brand-cyan/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan mb-6">
            <ShieldCheck class="w-6 h-6" />
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-cyan mb-2">JunXi Hex 柔性六维力传感器</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">打破刚性限制的视触觉力控</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            全球首创视触觉原理柔性六轴力传感器，以百元级硬件成本达到传统刚性传感器万元级精度（全量程误差 1-5FS%）。天然柔性顺应结构，无需力位转换即可保障人机协作与装配节拍安全。
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CheckCircle2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-cyan" />力/力矩感知 + 6D 位姿感知</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CheckCircle2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-cyan" />多通道独立力与位置反馈</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CheckCircle2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-cyan" />胜任打磨、抛光、按摩等柔顺场景</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- UMI Teleoperation Card -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-dark-900 border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-amber/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-amber/10 border border-brand-amber/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-amber mb-6">
            <Repeat class="w-6 h-6" />
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-amber mb-2">JunXi UMI 1:1 双手同构遥操作</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">采集端与执行端极致手感一致</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            含指甲高自由度仿生夹爪结构（仿拇指+食指），支持手指伸展至最前端进行贴桌塑料薄膜捏取与复杂揉搓。3小时视触Policy训练，1小时真机极速部署。
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CheckCircle2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-amber" />采集端与机器人执行端 1:1 物理同构</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CheckCircle2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-amber" />手部视觉 + 同构编码器 + TacPrint 指尖触觉</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CheckCircle2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-amber" />覆盖常规抓取突破无法复刻的微动作</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- World Simulator Card -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-dark-900 border border-white/10 hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 mb-6">
            <Globe class="w-6 h-6" />
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-2">交互式世界模型模拟器</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Long-horizon World Simulator</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            基于真机物理数据构建的交互式世界模型，在模型内部自动扩展合成交互时序数据。支持条件动作世界模型与 VLA 动作模型结合，大幅提升具身模型跨场景泛化能力。
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CheckCircle2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400" />Dyn Loss 动力学误差降低 44.5%</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CheckCircle2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400" />FVD 长周期动力学降低 15.4%</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CheckCircle2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400" />真机数据增广、仿真数采与强化学习</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
